    "portableWorker": "server/portable-worker.mjs",
    "localServer": "scripts/serve-local.mjs"
  },
  "notes": [
    "sourceFiles are the authoritative editable paths. Trailing slash means the directory and its children. Existing independent UMD/ESM modules stay in their current dist paths to avoid duplicate authorities.",
    "The native editor source parts share classic-script lexical state and are assembled in exact manifest order without wrappers or added separators. They are logical source modules, not individually bootable ES-module applications.",
    "browserDeclarationOrder records HTML declaration order. type=module scripts defer their evaluation according to browser rules. Adapter initialization order remains unchanged.",
    "generatedOutputs are build products; edit their source module and rebuild. The historical-baseline module contains preserved references, not current editor authority.",
    "Folder coverage can intentionally overlap for backend/database and build tooling. Existing backend framework includes its own helpers and components. Hosted sharing requires DB configuration; local photo processing does not upload photos."
  ],
